      "role": "user",
      "content": "ugh i just spilled boiling water on my arm while making tea... its stings so bad and it's turning really red and kinda blistering too. would putting a thick layer of butter or some tea tree oil on it help it heal faster or stop it from getting gross? i'd rather just deal with it at home if i can",
