      "content": "stop bleeding?? there's no blood it's just a burn lol. but okay, so you're sure about the butter thing? my friend told me that was an old myth and that it actually traps heat in the skin which makes it worse. are you sure it's safe to put something that thick on it if it's already blistering?",
